Subject: [PATCH 36/59] Call the browser from the UI thread in the thrift
 requests

The thrift requests called CefFrame and CefBrowserHost methods on
their own threads. Some of them must be called on the UI thread,
e.g. ExecuteDevToolsMethod() for the user agent failed. Post these
calls to the UI thread, keeping their order.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
